00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.540
Isn't this a little, ch-ch-ch-chia.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:02.840
Eraser pandas.

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.372
I love pandas, they're so cute.

00:01:04.372 --> 00:01:06.040
Do you guys see how cute these are?

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.380
It does work!

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.960
- This, you would not be able
to find at Family Dollar.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.890
- So I would definitely go
all the way to Hong Kong

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:12.723
