00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:35.219
- That's what I'm talking about.

00:01:35.219 --> 00:01:38.140
(upbeat music)

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:41.370
- You know, Hong Kong
just makes some very fine

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.203
