00:02:33.569 --> 00:02:35.910
(upbeat music)

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.040
I love this right here.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.632
You know I have so many different wigs.

00:02:38.632 --> 00:02:39.880
(laughs)

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.160
This is perfect.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.870
