00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:49.213
This is super cute.

00:02:49.213 --> 00:02:51.496
I would totally love to have this.

00:02:51.496 --> 00:02:52.480
- Okay, great.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.576
